@{
    ViewBag.Title = "School of Health (SoH)";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
    ViewBag.BodyClass = "SchoolOfHealth";
}
<main>
  <div class="section ">
    <div class="inner-banner">
      <div class="banner-img"><img src="assets/images/school-of-health-banner.webp" alt="Banner"></div>
      <div class="container h-100 position-relative z-index1">
        <div class="breadcrumb-wrap">
          <ol class="breadcrumb">
            <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/"><i class="bi bi-house-door"></i></a></li>
            <li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">School of Health (SoH)</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
        <div class="row justify-content-center align-items-center h-100">
          <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-10 col-lg-9">
            <div class="header-text">
              <div class="prod-heading" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="100" data-aos-duration="500">PIRAMAL SCHOOL OF LEADERSHIP</div>
              <div class="section_title mb-0" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="300" data-aos-duration="500">
                <h1>School of Health (SoH)</h1>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="section section-padding">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section_title text-center mb-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="0" data-aos-duration="500">
        <h2>Theory of Change</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="row mb-5 justify-content-center" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100" data-aos-duration="500">
        <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-11 text-center">
          <p>The School of Health’s philosophy is anchored in the bold vision of creating a nation of tempered radicals—public servants who possess the courage to challenge the status quo from within, while staying grounded in empathy, values, and purpose. We believe that true system transformation begins when individuals experience <b>Agency to Serve</b> - feeling empowered, supported, and intrinsically motivated to deliver services that restore dignity, trust, and compassion. To achieve this, public institutions must be intentionally designed not just for efficiency, but to unlock the full human potential of both those who serve and those who are served.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-panache rounded-3 p-4 p-lg-5 border" data-aos="fade" data-aos-delay="200" data-aos-duration="500">
        <div class="row justify-content-center" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300" data-aos-duration="500">
          <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg-10">
            <div class="row g-4 g-md-5">
              <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-11 col-lg-4">
                <div class="text_with_icon xxxl align-items-center flex-column gap-4 mb-1">
                  <span class="icon"><img src="assets/images/icons/centre-for-leadership-icon.svg" alt=""></span>
                  <div class="text-center">
                    <div class="fs-5 ff-roboto-serif mb-3 text-secondary">Centre for Leadership Development</div>
                    <p class="text-dark">Invests in the personal transformation of individuals—enhancing reflective thinking, emotional intelligence, and collaborative leadership. This pillar enables the shift from transactional to transformational governance by developing middle managers into empathetic, values-driven changemakers.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-11 col-lg-4">
                <div class="text_with_icon xxxl align-items-center flex-column gap-4 mb-1">
                  <span class="icon"><img src="assets/images/icons/centre-for-organizational-icon.svg" alt=""></span>
                  <div class="text-center">
                    <div class="fs-5 ff-roboto-serif mb-3 text-secondary">Centre for Organizational Development</div>
                    <p class="text-dark">Focuses on reengineering institutional structures by clarifying goals, redefining roles, and fostering a culture of ownership and accountability. The aim: to create systems that are not just efficient, but deeply human-centric and purpose-led.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-11 col-lg-4">
                <div class="text_with_icon xxxl align-items-center flex-column gap-4 mb-1">
                  <span class="icon"><img src="assets/images/icons/centre-for-medical-icon.svg" alt=""></span>
                  <div class="text-center">
                    <div class="fs-5 ff-roboto-serif mb-3 text-secondary">Centre for Medical Services</div>
                    <p class="text-dark">Drives a shift from volume to value—ensuring care is both accessible and compassionate. Efforts include building soft skills in healthcare workers, improving last-mile delivery, and integrating technology to strengthen diagnostics and referral systems.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-11 col-lg-4">
                <div class="text_with_icon xxxl align-items-center flex-column gap-4 mb-1">
                  <span class="icon"><img src="assets/images/icons/centre-for-public-health-icon.svg" alt=""></span>
                  <div class="text-center">
                    <div class="fs-5 ff-roboto-serif mb-3 text-secondary">Centre for Public Health Services</div>
                    <p class="text-dark">Aligns health systems with community needs and equity goals by decentralizing decision-making, promoting preventive health, and encouraging intersectoral collaboration. Strengthens trust between frontline workers and marginalized communities by integrating indigenous knowledge systems into formal care.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-11 col-lg-4">
                <div class="text_with_icon xxxl align-items-center flex-column gap-4 mb-1">
                  <span class="icon"><img src="assets/images/icons/quality-improvement-icon.svg" alt=""></span>
                  <div class="text-center">
                    <div class="fs-5 ff-roboto-serif mb-3 text-secondary">Quality Improvement</div>
                    <p class="text-dark">Acts as a continuous feedback loop that powers system evolution. Through data, frontline innovation, and iterative learning, QI cultivates a culture of excellence. Initiatives like Sitamarhi’s respectful maternal care model show how small changes lead to large-scale impact.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-11 col-lg-4">
                <div class="text_with_icon xxxl align-items-center flex-column gap-4 mb-1">
                  <span class="icon"><img src="assets/images/icons/gender-and-diversity-icon.svg" alt=""></span>
                  <div class="text-center">
                    <div class="fs-5 ff-roboto-serif mb-3 text-secondary">Gender and Diversity</div>
                    <p class="text-dark">A cross-cutting lens that embeds gender equity at every level of the system. Goes beyond sensitivity to transformation—by challenging structural patriarchy, supporting female leadership, and ensuring safe, empowering environments for women across public health and governance.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>


            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="section section-padding bg-secondary">
    <div class="container text-white">
      <div class="section_title text-center mb-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="0" data-aos-duration="500">
        <h2 class="text-white">Centres of Excellence</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="row mb-5 justify-content-center" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100" data-aos-duration="500">
        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-11 col-lg-10 text-center">
          <p>Together, these components reflect a comprehensive theory of change where personal transformation catalyzes systems transformation, leading to societal transformation. This vision is reflected in the Talent Systems approach of the School of Health and aligns with Piramal Foundation’s long-standing philosophy of unlocking human potential through deep empathy, structured capacity building, and collaborative innovation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-11 col-lg-9">
          <div class="row g-5 mb-3 justify-content-center" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200" data-aos-duration="500">
            <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
              <div class="all-card">
                <a href="soh-centre-for-leadership-development">
                  <div class="image ratio ratio-1x1">
                    <img src="assets/images/centre-for-leadership-development-img.jpg" alt="">
                  </div>
                  <div class="header">Centre for Leadership Development</div>
                  <div class="copy">Empowering individuals with emotional intelligence and reflective leadership for transformational governance.</div>
                  <div class="card_footer">
                    <span class="btn"><i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right"></i> Know More </span>
                  </div>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
              <div class="all-card">
                <a href="soh-centre-for-organizational-development">
                  <div class="image ratio ratio-1x1">
                    <img src="assets/images/Centre-for-Organizational-Development-img.jpg" alt="">
                  </div>
                  <div class="header">Centre for Organizational Development</div>
                  <div class="copy">Redesigning institutional systems to be human-centric, accountable, and values-driven.</div>
                  <div class="card_footer">
                    <span class="btn"><i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right"></i> Know More </span>
                  </div>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
              <div class="all-card">
                <a href="soh-centre-for-medical-services">
                  <div class="image ratio ratio-1x1">
                    <img src="assets/images/Centre-for-Medical-Services-img.jpg" alt="">
                  </div>
                  <div class="header">Centre for Medical Services</div>
                  <div class="copy">Transforming care delivery through compassion, last-mile access, and tech-enabled diagnostics.</div>
                  <div class="card_footer">
                    <span class="btn"><i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right"></i> Know More </span>
                  </div>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
              <div class="all-card">
                <a href="soh-centre-for-public-health-services">
                  <div class="image ratio ratio-1x1">
                    <img src="assets/images/Centre-for-Public-Health-Services-img.jpg" alt="">
                  </div>
                  <div class="header">Centre for Public Health Services</div>
                  <div class="copy">Building equitable, community-aligned health systems rooted in trust and collaboration.</div>
                  <div class="card_footer">
                    <span class="btn"><i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right"></i> Know More </span>
                  </div>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
              <div class="all-card">
                <a href="soh-centre-for-quality-improvement">
                  <div class="image ratio ratio-1x1">
                    <img src="assets/images/Centre-for-Quality-Improvement-img.jpg" alt="">
                  </div>
                  <div class="header">Centre for Quality Improvement</div>
                  <div class="copy">Driving continuous system excellence through frontline innovation and data-driven feedback.</div>
                  <div class="card_footer">
                    <span class="btn"><i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right"></i> Know More </span>
                  </div>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
              <div class="all-card">
                <a href="soh-gender-and-diversity">
                  <div class="image ratio ratio-1x1">
                    <img src="assets/images/Gender-and-Diversity-img.jpg" alt="">
                  </div>
                  <div class="header">Gender and Diversity</div>
                  <div class="copy">Embedding equity and inclusion by transforming institutions through a gender-just lens.</div>
                  <div class="card_footer">
                    <span class="btn"><i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right"></i> Know More </span>
                  </div>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>


          </div>
        </div>
      </div>


    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="section section-padding bg-panache">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section_title text-center mb-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="0" data-aos-duration="500">
        <h2>Latest Stories</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="row mb-5 justify-content-center" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100" data-aos-duration="500">
        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-11 col-lg-11 text-center">
          <p>Explore how change is unfolding with the latest insights, stories, and breakthroughs shaping public systems in India.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="three-col-slider mb-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200" data-aos-duration="500">
                <div class="swiper swiper-container">
                    <div class="swiper-wrapper" id="divStoryContent">
                    </div>
                    <div class="swiper-button swiper-button-all">
                        <div class="swiper-buttons">
                            <div class="swiper-button-prev"></div>
                            <div class="swiper-pagination"></div>
                            <div class="swiper-button-next"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

      </div>


    </div>
  </div>

</main>
